{# Twig is Symfony's template engine — Blade's counterpart.
   Variables passed from PHP are used with {{ }}. #}
<p>Hi {{ displayName }},</p>

<p>Welcome to Orbly. Please confirm your email address to activate your account:</p>

<p>
    {# signedUrl is generated by the bundle and already contains the user id,
       the expiry, and the HMAC signature. Never build this by hand. #}
    <a href="{{ signedUrl }}">Confirm my email</a>
</p>

<p>This link expires in {{ expiresInMinutes }} minutes.</p>

<p>If you didn't create an Orbly account, you can ignore this email.</p>
